  "releaseNotes": "Additions:\nmove cwl related functions\nrename PropertyValue.fs to ScalarValue.fs\nrename PropertyValue to ScalarValue\nbump node\nupdate python min requirement\nMerge origin/main into update_fable\naccess controller members as properties in python tests\nbuild typescript package against fable-library-ts\ntype DTO.Spreadsheet as FsWorkbook instead of obj\nupdate fable, fsspreadsheet, thoth and fsharp.core dependencies\nDeletions:\nremove old dynamicobject fallback\nadd Fable.Python reference to tests to remove warnings\nBugfixes:\nfix python comparison and hashing of OntologyAnnotation\nfix python static properties, string hashing and ResizeArray type tests\nfix python ToString and RO-Crate process input decoding",
